{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ClosureProtocol"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ClosureProtocol\/setMetaMarshal(marshalData:metaMarshal:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setMetaMarshal","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"marshalData"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:gtypes.h@T@gpointer","text":"gpointer","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"metaMarshal","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"GClosureMarshal","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:gclosure.h@T@GClosureMarshal"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A meta marshaller wraps the ","type":"text"},{"code":"closure","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s marshal and modifies the way"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"it is called in some fashion. The most common use of this facility"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is for C callbacks."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The same marshallers (generated by ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"#glib-genmarshal","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"are used everywhere, but the way that we get the callback function"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"differs. In most cases we want to use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"closure"},{"type":"text","text":"’s callback, but in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other cases we want to use some different technique to retrieve the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callback function."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, class closures for signals (see","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"g_signal_type_cclosure_new()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") retrieve the callback function from a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"fixed offset in the class structure.  The meta marshaller retrieves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the right callback and passes it to the marshaller as the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"marshalData","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" argument.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/glibobject\/closureprotocol\/setmetamarshal(marshaldata:metamarshal:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets the meta marshaller of ","type":"text"},{"code":"closure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GLibObject","externalID":"s:10GLibObject15ClosureProtocolPAAE14setMetaMarshal11marshalData04metaG0ySvSg_ySpySo9_GClosureVGSg_SpySo7_GValueVGSgs6UInt32VSPyAMGSgA2GtXCtF","role":"symbol","title":"setMetaMarshal(marshalData:metaMarshal:)","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setMetaMarshal"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"marshalData","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"gpointer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:gtypes.h@T@gpointer"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"text":"metaMarshal","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"GClosureMarshal","preciseIdentifier":"c:gclosure.h@T@GClosureMarshal","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"GLibObject"}]},"references":{"#glib